#: includes/Privacy.php:102
msgid "Navexa AgeCheck for WooCommerce checks the age of shoppers who order age-restricted products. The text below says what the plugin sends to Navexa AgeCheck and what it keeps in your store. Adjust it to your store's settings (for example, whether Cloudflare Turnstile is on)."
